90356348","name":"OpenDroid","packageName":"com.opendroid.aiagent","summary":"Autonomous AI agent that controls your phone for you","versions":[{"added":1790356348,"versionCode":9,"versionName":"1.0.8"}]},{"authorName":"Adrian Van der Berg","categories":["Writing"],"description":"Make any PDF document or e-book on your phone: page sizes, voice typing, read-aloud, export and share.","license":"Proprietary","name":"PDF Creator","packageName":"com.mandy.pdfcreator","summary":"Create PDF documents and e-books, fully accessible"},{"added":"1790698084","authorName":"Adrian Van der Berg","categories":["System"],"description":"Mandy Keyboard: a big, talking keyboard for blind users. Voice typing powered by Mandy's AI in English or Afrikaans, with auto-detect. Clipboard, capitals, numbers, enter, delete and clear. Every key speaks out loud when touched.","lastUpdated":"1790698084","license":"Proprietary","name":"Mandy Keyboard","packageName":"com.mandy.mandykeyboard","summary":"Accessible AI keyboard with Mandy voice typing","versions":[{"apkName":"MandyKeyboard_v1_signed.apk","hashType":"sha256","minSdkVersion":"21","sha256":"6722df68a15ad3f860dcf635ea4459a771630accbc5393e86fb4f043d9c7e974","sig":"5953401e6ea40fe82b21abf5a0eaa73562617814d9dc9225c6b7400fc4b47ff9","size":26608,"url":"MandyKeyboard_v1_signed.apk","versionCode":1,"versionName":"1.0"}],"webSite":"https://github.com/avanderberg48-collab/fdroid-repo"},{"added":"1790841563","authorName":"Adrian Van der Berg","categories":["Accessibility"],"description":"Shine Plus: a complete screen reader for blind users. Explore by touch, double-tap to activate, swipe to navigate, two-finger gestures to read everything. English and Afrikaans, adjustable voice, spoken tutorial.","lastUpdated":"1790841563","license":"Proprietary","name":"Shine Plus","packageName":"com.mandy.shineplus","summary":"Full screen reader: explore by touch, swipe navigation, read all","versions":[{"apkName":"ShinePlus_v1_signed.apk","hashType":"sha256","minSdkVersion":"24","sha256":"f9b8883316a8fcb03a52ab46e14b891047e966ba194f4da759003a07554f26c5","sig":"5953401e6ea40fe82b21abf5a0eaa73562617814d9dc9225c6b7400fc4b47ff9","size":2399627,"url":"ShinePlus_v1_signed.apk","versionCode":1,"versionName":"1.0"}],"webSite":"https://github.com/avanderberg48-collab/fdroid-repo"},{"added":"1791022646","authorName":"Adrian Van der Berg","categories":["Accessibility"],"description":"NVDA Mobile is a full screen reader modelled on the NVDA screen reader for Windows, built for blind users. Explore by touch: drag your finger and everything speaks. Double-tap activates. Swipe right or down for the next item, left or up for the previous. Three-finger tap switches between object mode and text review mode: navigate by character, word and line like the NVDA review cursor. Two-finger swipe down starts say-all with auto scroll; two-finger swipe right continues from the current item. Two-finger double-tap opens the NVDA menu with reports: current object, window title, time, date, battery, clipboard, spell and spell with character descriptions. Quick navigation jumps between buttons, edit fields, checkboxes, links, images, text blocks and lists. Input help mode makes every gesture announce what it does. Speech modes: speech, beeps or off. Per-app sleep mode keeps the reader silent in apps that speak for themselves. Screen curtain turns the display black while speech keeps working. Speaks Afrikaans or English with adjustable rate, pitch and volume, haptic feedback and a floating NVDA menu button.","lastUpdated":"1791022646","license":"Proprietary","name":"NVDA Mobile","packageName":"com.mandy.nvdamobile","summary":"NVDA-style screen reader with review cursor and say-all","versions":[{"added":"1791022646","version":"1.0","versionCode":"1"}]},{"added":"1791097884","authorName":"Adrian Van der Berg","categories":["System"],"description":"Mandy Mistral Keyboard: a big, talking keyboard for blind users. AI voice typing powered 100 percent by Mistral 